BT /F1 11 Tf 72 624.5999999999999 Td (year.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 596.5499999999998 Td (The plan sets one headline goal: no more than 200 properties should flood in a storm as) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 72 581.6999999999998 Td (severe as 2027 by the year 2040. It combines hard defences, natural storage and managed) Tj ET
